// Title: Free Disk Space Wiped with cipher /w
// ATT&CK: T1561.001 | Tactic: Impact | Sigma id: a101518c-a089-4552-a193-17b02d9e3928
// Data source: DeviceProcessEvents (Microsoft Defender for Endpoint / Defender XDR connector)
// Severity: Medium
// False positives: Users and decommissioning scripts securely wiping free space
// Suggested analytics rule: run every 15m, look back 30m, alert when results > 0.
// Entity mapping: Host = DeviceName, Account = AccountName, Process = ProcessCommandLine
// The time filter below is for ad-hoc hunting; the analytics rule's lookback applies when scheduled.
DeviceProcessEvents
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)
| where FolderPath endswith "\\cipher.exe" and ProcessCommandLine contains "/w"
| project TimeGenerated, DeviceName, AccountName, InitiatingProcessFileName, InitiatingProcessCommandLine, FileName, FolderPath, ProcessCommandLine
